		<SWF></SWF>
		<Meldungstext>\TReading from the left:
 1. DTC memory: 0 = No malfunction; 1 = Malfunction
 2. Transmission intervention during gear change:
 			0 = Without intervention; 1 = With intervention
 3. A/C compressor: 0 = Off; 1 = On
 4. Idle switch: 0 = Closed; 1 = Open
 5. Oxygen sensor control: 0 = OK; 1 = not OK
 6. Throttle valve: 0 = Closed; 1 = Open
 7. Engine speed: 0 = &lt; 1800 RPM; 1 = &gt; 1800 RPM
 8. Coolant temperature: 0 = &gt; 80 °C; 1 = &lt; 80°C</Meldungstext>
